---
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import ClosingCta from '../components/ClosingCta.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { breadcrumbList, serviceNode } from '../lib/schema';
import { offers } from '../offers';
import { SITE_URL, SERVICE_AREA_PLACES } from '../site';
const title = 'Tech Advisor in Northern Virginia | Danny McGiffin';
const description = 'Independent, vendor-neutral tech advice for Northern Virginia businesses: Tech Audits, Second Opinions, AI Opportunity assessments, and Data Connection. Based in Herndon.';
const pageUrl = `${SITE_URL}/northern-virginia-ai-workflow-automation/`;
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} image="/og/northern-virginia.png" imageAlt="Independent tech advisor in Northern Virginia. Danny McGiffin, based in Herndon." structuredData={[breadcrumbList([{name:'Home',url:`${SITE_URL}/`},{name:'Northern Virginia',url:pageUrl}]),serviceNode({id:`${pageUrl}#service`,name:'Independent technology advice',description,url:pageUrl,areaServed:SERVICE_AREA_PLACES})]}>
  <SiteHeader bookingPlacement="nova-navigation" /><main id="main-content"><PageIntro eyebrow="Herndon / Northern Virginia" title="An independent tech advisor in Northern Virginia." deck="Vendor-neutral advice for owners and executives across the Washington, DC area. Based in Herndon, and close enough to see the real work." />
  <article class="prose service-prose shell"><h2>Four ways to work together.</h2><p>I’m Danny McGiffin, an independent tech advisor based in Herndon. I don’t sell software or take referral fees, so the answer can be to buy nothing.</p><ul>{offers.map(item => <li><a href={item.href}><strong>{item.name}</strong></a>: {item.oneLiner} {item.price}, {item.duration.toLowerCase()}.</li>)}</ul><h2>Sometimes the work is stopping the wrong project.</h2><p>For a PE-backed distributor, I found that an enterprise ERP couldn’t represent the relationships at the heart of its business. The CEO canceled the implementation, and I designed an alternative around the systems already in use, estimated at about 2% of the projected ERP path.</p><p><a href="/case-studies/">Read the case studies ↗</a></p><h2>Close enough to see the real work.</h2><p>Herndon is home base. I work across Northern Virginia and the Washington, DC area, including Reston, Chantilly, Fairfax, Tysons, McLean, Vienna, Ashburn, Leesburg, Arlington, and Alexandria, as well as Loudoun and Fairfax counties.</p><p>Some work is on site; some is remote. The choice depends on what we need to understand and who needs to be involved. Those are service areas, not a list of offices.</p><h2>A useful fit.</h2><p>This work is for owners, executives, and senior operators at founder-led or privately held businesses where a technology decision carries real money, and who are willing to look at what is actually happening.</p></article><ClosingCta placement="nova-closing" /></main><SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
